        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Super Farmer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Farmer is a fast-paced top-down arcade game about one simple goal:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest more fruit than anyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through 100 colorful orchard levels, grab fruit before your rivals do, avoid pests, manage your energy, and use powerful items to turn the match in your favor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Hand-Crafted Levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start simple, then face harder layouts, tighter goals, smarter rivals, and more chaotic orchard challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Arcade Harvesting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, collect, dodge, and compete for the best fruit spots before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rival Farmers and Pests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the orchard. Other farmers want the same fruit, and pests will try to ruin your perfect harvest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special items to change the situation instantly:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fruit Magnet: Pull fruit toward you and harvest faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Slow Trap: Slow down rivals and take control of the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Freeze Aura: Make fruit respond only to you for a short time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fog Bomb: Confuse enemies and create a chance to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple, but later levels require planning, timing, movement, and smart item usage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you clear all 100 levels and become the ultimate Super Farmer?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Super Farmer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Farmer is a fast-paced top-down arcade game about one simple goal:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest more fruit than anyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through 100 colorful orchard levels, grab fruit before your rivals do, avoid pests, manage your energy, and use powerful items to turn the match in your favor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Hand-Crafted Levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start simple, then face harder layouts, tighter goals, smarter rivals, and more chaotic orchard challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Arcade Harvesting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, collect, dodge, and compete for the best fruit spots before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rival Farmers and Pests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the orchard. Other farmers want the same fruit, and pests will try to ruin your perfect harvest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special items to change the situation instantly:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fruit Magnet: Pull fruit toward you and harvest faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Slow Trap: Slow down rivals and take control of the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Freeze Aura: Make fruit respond only to you for a short time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fog Bomb: Confuse enemies and create a chance to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple, but later levels require planning, timing, movement, and smart item usage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you clear all 100 levels and become the ultimate Super Farmer?</p>",
